{"unit_id":"tag:08U6:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节利用朴素余切复形（naive cotangent complex）研究一点形变理论（deformation theory）。我们从一个一阶增厚（first order thickening）<MATH_0001>开始，它是赋环空间（ringed spaces）的增厚。记<MATH_0002>，并将<MATH_0003>与<MATH_0004>的底层拓扑空间（topological spaces）视为相同。此外，假设给定一个赋环空间的态射（morphism of ringed spaces）<MATH_0005>、一个<MATH_0006>-模（module）<MATH_0007>，以及一个<MATH_0008>-映射（map）<MATH_0009>，它是模（modules）的层（sheaves）之间的映射（《层（Sheaves）》定义<REF_0001>及第<REF_0002>节）。本节要问，能否找到问号填入下面的图（diagram）<MATH_0010>（其中垂直箭头是<MATH_0011>-映射（maps）），以及解（solution）有多唯一（如果存在）。更准确地，我们寻求一个一阶增厚（first order thickening）<MATH_0012>和一个增厚的态射（morphism of thickenings）<MATH_0013>，如（<REF_0003>）中所述，其中<MATH_0014>与<MATH_0015>视为相同，使得<MATH_0016>诱导给定映射（map）<MATH_0017>。我们将称<MATH_0018>为（<REF_0004>）的一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>解（solution）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"naive cotangent complex","target_term":"朴素余切复形"},{"source_term":"deformation theory","target_term":"形变理论"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"赋环空间"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed spaces","target_term":"赋环空间的态射"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"Sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"morphism of thickenings","target_term":"增厚的态射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"naive cotangent complex","target_term":"朴素余切复形","context":"本节的复形，译法待决"},{"source_term":"deformation theory","target_term":"形变理论","context":"形变问题，译法待决"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"所述增厚，译法待决"},{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"赋环空间","context":"增厚的空间，译法待决"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"底层空间，译法待决"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed spaces","target_term":"赋环空间的态射","context":"给定基态射，译法待决"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"给定模，译法待决"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"给定或诱导映射，译法待决"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"模的层，译法待决"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"模层，译法待决"},{"source_term":"Sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"引用章名，译法待决"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"所述提升图，译法待决"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"垂直箭头，译法待决"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解","context":"所述形变问题的解，译法待决"},{"source_term":"morphism of thickenings","target_term":"增厚的态射","context":"解中的增厚态射，译法待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08U8:statement","translation":"假设给定一个赋环空间（ringed spaces）的态射（morphisms）的交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0001>，其水平（horizontal）箭头是一阶增厚（first order thickenings）。置<MATH_0002>，并假设给定一个<MATH_0003>-映射（map）<MATH_0004>，它是模（modules）的映射，产生交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0005>，其前面和后面是（<REF_0001>）的解（solutions）。<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>存在一个典范的（canonical）元素（element），属于<MATH_0006>，其为零是存在一个赋环空间的态射（morphism of ringed spaces）<MATH_0007>填入（<REF_0002>）并与<MATH_0008>相容的充要条件。<STRUCT_0003>如果存在一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>填入（<REF_0003>）并与<MATH_0010>相容，那么所有这些态射（morphisms）的集合（set）是<MATH_0011>作用下的主齐性空间（principal homogeneous space）。<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"赋环空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"solutions","target_term":"解"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范的"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed spaces","target_term":"赋环空间的态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous space","target_term":"主齐性空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"赋环空间","context":"给定图，译法待决"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"图的态射及相容态射，译法待决"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"增厚的图，译法待决"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平","context":"箭头方向，译法待决"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"水平箭头，译法待决"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"给定映射，译法待决"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"